venue. In FY2021 it was $344 million.","cites":["PTC.ocf.2026","PTC.capex.2026","PTC.revenue.2026","PTC.ocf.2021","PTC.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $252 million in FY2026, 9.2% of revenue, against 9.8% in FY2021.","cites":["PTC.sbc.2026","PTC.revenue.2026","PTC.sbc.2021","PTC.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $1.6 billion to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["PTC.buybacks.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-30 revenue was $673 million (the fiscal year less its first nine months: computed from two filed figures), down 24.7% from $894 million in the three months ended 2025-09-30.","cites":["PTC.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","PTC.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.revenue.2024-10-01.2025-09-30","PTC.d.revenue.2024-10-01.2025-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-30 revenue added up to $2.7 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $896 million and net income to $1 billion.","cites":["PTC.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","PTC.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","PTC.d.revenue.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","PTC.d.revenue.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","PTC.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","PTC.d.opinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","PTC.d.opinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","PTC.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-03-31","PTC.d.netinc.2026-04-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","PTC.d.netinc.2025-10-01.2026-06-30"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $873 million: operating cash flow of $899 million less capital spending of $25.9 million (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["PTC.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","PTC.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","PTC.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.ocf.2025-10-01.2026-09-30","PTC.d.capex.2025-10-01.2025-12-31","PTC.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-03-31","PTC.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-06-30","PTC.d.capex.2025-10-01.2026-09-30"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $8.3 million in total and $8.2 million actually paid.","cites":["PTC.pay.neoTotal.2025","PTC.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $245.43 at the end of FY2025, and $284.85 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["PTC.pay.tsr.2025","PTC.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $2.7 billion at the end of FY2026, against $2.9 billion a year earlier. That is 100.2% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["PTC.rpo.2026","PTC.rpo.2025","PTC.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $805 million at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $812 million a year earlier.","cites":["PTC.deferred.2026","PTC.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 7,305 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $374,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["PTC.q.employees","PTC.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $6.2 million, after $15.6 million in FY2025.","cites":["PTC.restructuring.2026","PTC.restructuring.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $233 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $1.6 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebt). Debt less cash was $1.4 billion (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["PTC.cash.2026","PTC.debtTotal.2026"]}]},"fin":{"PTC":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":35,"read":35,"other":0,"failed